{
  "description": "Chief home resolution shared by the cmux-next app (ChiefHome.swift) and the cmux CLI (cmux-tui cli/chief/home.rs). `tag` is the app's build tag; the CLI reads it from CMUX_TAG. `isolated` null: the app and the CLI may differ (an explicit home).",
  "cases": [
